 ∆GetLinkOption←{
⍝ Returns the value of the Link option ⍺ (like 'watch') that Link actually uses for the linked namespace ⍵.
⍝ ⍵ may be a name or a ref. This checks what reached Link, not what Cider put into CiderConfig.LINK.
⍝ Relies on the Link-internal ⎕SE.Link.Links; returns ⍬ when ⍵ is not linked or ⍺ is not set.
     0=⎕NC'⎕SE.Link.Links':⍬
     links←⎕SE.Link.Links
     0=≢links:⍬
     ind←links.ns⍳⊂⍕⍵
     ind>≢links:⍬
     link←ind⊃links
     0=link.⎕NC ⍺:⍬
     link⍎⍺
 }
